# Sage 11 theme — Prettier ignore. Copy to the theme root as `.prettierignore`.
#
# On the plain Pantheon upstream this kit targets, vendor/ and public/build/ are
# COMMITTED (there is no build step on deploy). That puts third-party code and
# minified build output in front of the formatter — Laravel ships its own
# .blade.php views under vendor/illuminate/pagination/, and reformatting them
# breaks CLAUDE.md's "never modify third-party files" rule.
#
# The `lint-staged` glob is already scoped to {app,resources}; this file is the
# second guard, and also covers a manual `npx prettier --write .`.
/vendor/
/public/
/node_modules/
